SUMMARY:Santa is coming to These Boots!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Location: Keating Channel P
 ub**\n**2 Villiers St\, Toronto\, ON M5A 1B1 (two blocks north of Commissi
 oner's Street**\n\\*There is lots of free parking\n\n**XMAS IS COMING AND 
 WHO BETTER TO CELEBRATE WITH BUT THESE BOOTS!**\nHang up your Hiking Boots
  for one night and get ready to kick up your heels! It's a night of holida
 y cheer\, questionable dance moves\, and great music.\n**Wear your best or
  silly xmas outfit to kick off the season.**\n**\\ *DJ Neil on the decks -
  Get ready to dance the night away**\n**\\* Prizes and Surprises - You nev
 er know what you might win**\n**\\ *Santa is coming to Town - And he knows
  if you have been naughty or nice!**\n**\\* Catered nibbles- meat and vegg
 ie options (not dinner and we cannot accommodate special diets)**\n\\* **C
 ash Bar**\n**Price is $30. until Dec 1. Then the price goes up to $35. Pri
 ce cover the DJ\, nibbles and other costs.**\nPlease send dollars to\nboot
 s4hikingthesix@gmail.com\nNo exchange or refunds.\nMerry Christmas Boots! 
 Lets get this party started!
