SUMMARY:Get Happy in the Happy Valley Forest with Nouman!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMeetup Location: https://maps
 .app.goo.gl/shjV12StK8KjaVpWA?g_st=ic\nWho needs drugs or alcohol when you
  are hiking through the Happy Forest with Nouman!\nWinding through one of 
 the largest remaining forests blocks of the oak ridges moraine this loop h
 ighlights rich forests and sweeping countryside vistas\nA 14.5 km hike mak
 e it a solid days hike through a moderately challenging route!\,\nPlease c
 ome prepared with layers\, water\, lunch and solid footwear.
